Subject: [PATCH 3/4] =?UTF-8?q?dsv41=20zig:=202D=20(world=3D4)=20dense=20w?=
 =?UTF-8?q?o=5Fb=20decode=20path=20=E2=80=94=20exchange=20the=20pair's=20p?=
 =?UTF-8?q?lain=20u=20into=20xb=20and=20gemm=20on=20full=20width=20(was=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?notPorted)?=
